OL,3,GNEWSAWalk-in hours cut at NHS urgent
OL,4,Atreatment centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS bosses have announced a reduction
OL,7,Fin walk-in opening hours at four urgent
OL,8,Ftreatment centres (UTCs) in Derbyshire.
OL,10,FFrom Monday, walk-ins will no longer be
OL,11,Favailable between 17:00 BST and 20:00
OL,12,Fat UTCs in Ripley, Ilkeston and
OL,13,FMatlock, and will be appointment only
OL,14,Fvia NHS 111. Walk-ins will also no
OL,15,Flonger be available in Buxton after
OL,16,F16:00.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
