OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAWalk-in hours cut at NHS urgent
OL,4,Atreatment centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerbyshire Community Health Services
OL,7,Fsaid the changes were being introduced
OL,8,Fto "help manage increasing demand and
OL,9,Fensure patients are assessed and
OL,10,Fdirected to the most appropriate
OL,11,Fservice".
OL,13,FLabour MP for Erewash, Adam Thompson,
OL,14,Fsaid he was "very disappointed" at the
OL,15,Fmove and is seeking a meeting with
OL,16,Fhealth bosses to reinstate evening
OL,17,Fwalk-in appointments.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
